        <mxCell id="eNYUcsIyRo49kigFaYzq-587" value="USART1 DMA RX/TX init (shell/log)&#xa;USART6 DMA init (referee RX)&#xa;CAN1+CAN2 filter+start+IRQ&#xa;PWM start: TIM8(friction), TIM10(IMU)&#xa;  TIM4(buzzer)&#xa;BMI088 SPI device init&#xa;Protocol stack object init&#xa;Register 1ms timers: USB TX flush,&#xa;  beep ctrl, LED toggle, motor CAN out&#xa;DR16/DBUS UART + DMA init&#xa;Referee protocol init&#xa;RX/TX callback wiring for all interfaces" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=5;" parent="eNYUcsIyRo49kigFaYzq-534" vertex="1">
