        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eNYUcsIyRo49kigFaYzq-682" value="OLED Display: NOT IMPLEMENTED in this firmware. I2C1 (PB8/PB9, 400kHz) is HAL-initialized but has no application driver.&#xa;All device status feedback is through: (1) Buzzer beep count (TIM4), (2) LED R/G/B GPIO, (3) USART1 log output (921600 baud).&#xa;To add OLED: implement SSD1306/SH1106 I2C driver on hi2c1, add display_task to show motor/RC/gimbal status in real-time." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFCC;strokeColor=#CC0000;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=5;fontColor=#CC0000;strokeWidth=2;" parent="eNYUcsIyRo49kigFaYzq-534" vertex="1">
